cloud-hypervisor (52.0-0ubuntu1) stonking; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. (LP: #2158959)
  * New upstream release v52.0.
  * Vendor all Rust dependencies in a separate orig tarball.
  * Build for amd64, arm64, and riscv64.
  * d/p/0001-arch-vmm-fix-riscv64-build-gaps.patch: cherry-pick upstream
    commit 1e18716fbdc0 to fix riscv64 build.
  * d/p/0002-vmm-allow-riscv64-path-syscalls-in-seccomp-filters.patch:
    cherry-pick upstream commit 7d1321515cac to fix riscv64 seccomp filters.
  * d/p/0003-riscv64-clamp-AIA-SRCS-to-KVM-device-capacity.patch:
    cherry-pick upstream commits 085642dd423e and 649ca23345cc to clamp AIA
    interrupt sources to KVM device capacity, fixing EINVAL on riscv64
    platforms with smaller IMSIC capacity.

